1
00:00:00,006 --> 00:00:04,306
(Leonard:)But every time I talk to her about
moving out, she cries and we have sex.

2
00:00:05,053 --> 00:00:08,473
(Raj:)You're lucky.
With me, it's usually the other way around.

3
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:12,723
(Howard:)You know, if you can't talk to her,
why don't you just text her?

4
00:00:13,061 --> 00:00:16,941
- Isn't that kind of cowardly?
- Oh, yeah. It's beyond contemptible.

5
00:00:17,399 --> 00:00:21,189
That's true. But, on the other hand,
you are wearing a bird sweater.

6
00:00:25,407 --> 00:00:27,077
(Leonard:)Sold.

7
00:00:29,327 --> 00:00:32,617
"I think it would be better
for our relationship...

8
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:36,249
...if you moved back to your place."

9
00:00:37,169 --> 00:00:38,709
(Steph:)There.

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,420
(Leonard:)- It's done.
- Good for you.

11
00:00:42,591 --> 00:00:45,131
(Leonard:)Yeah, good for me.

12
00:00:45,594 --> 00:00:47,094
(Leonard:)I'll never have sex again.

13
00:00:48,722 --> 00:00:50,472
[PHONE BUZZING]

14
00:00:52,851 --> 00:01:02,021
Oh, I was wrong. See you.

